<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistani rupee closing rates in kerb market.</title>
<headline>Pakistani rupee closing rates in kerb market.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Monday's spot rupee rates in the kerb market from Khanani &amp; Kalia Int'l (Pvt) Ltd:</p>
<p>				Buying rate	 Selling rate</p>
<p>    U.S. dollar	   41.13		 41.18</p>
<p>    Pound sterling	67.05		 67.15</p>
<p>    Deutsche mark	 24.20		 24.25</p>
<p>    Japanese yen	   0.329		 0.331</p>
<p>    Saudi riyal	   10.95		 10.97</p>
<p>    UAE dirham	    11.20		 11.22</p>
<p>    Indian rupee	   1.09		  1.11</p>
<p>    F.E.B.C.		 2.40 pct	    2.60 pct</p>
</text>
